data: {"id": "77721463c8564621-final", "run_id": "77721463c8564621", "seq": 1369, "ts_ms": 1788808474515, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l` | NotReady | Pod NotReady (0/1 Ready) |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes (fact-4bc793d4dc58) | `Ready` status: `False`, Reason: `ContainersNotReady` | 确认 Pod 处于 NotReady 状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet (fact-736ccd20854a) | `Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503` | 确认健康检查最终报错，频次 311 次 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet (fact-bc9524347579) | `dial tcp 172.16.104.35:8080/ready: connect: connection refused` | 指出探针连接被拒的具体时刻和端口 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus (fact-cb9fa78d4ee5) | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`: 0 | 排除因容器 OOM 或崩溃重启导致服务未拉起的可能性 |\n| 5 | Tracing | deepflow (fact-858f043c6099) | HTTP GET `dst_ip=172.16.104.35:8080/work` -> 503 (9次) | 证明业务流量同样遭遇 503，确认为服务端逻辑故障 |\n| 6 | Logging | elasticsearch (fact-09bb87865322) | `dependency unavailable` (pattern, 8次) | 业务日志直接声明“依赖不可用”，解释 503 产生原因 |\n\n证据链表明：Pod 运行正常且未重启（Metric #4），但业务应用因“依赖不可用”（Logging #6）主动返回 503，导致 Kubelet 探针在 172.16.104.35:8080 端口持续被拒（Event #3）或收到 503（Event #2），最终触发 Tracing #5 中的全流量 503 异常。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nApplication dependency unavailable → HTTP 503 on /ready → Readiness probe failure (x311) → Pod NotReady\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：应用服务依赖不可用导致就绪探针（Readiness Probe）持续失败。\n具体表现为应用业务日志明确记录 `dependency unavailable` (Logging #6)，且业务流量 (Tracing #5) 与健康检查流量 (Event #2) 均收到 HTTP 503 响应，导致 Kubernetes 判定容器未就绪 (K8s State #1)。\n\n**未确认/缺失事实**：\n1. **具体缺失依赖对象**：日志仅报告“依赖不可用”，未指明具体是数据库、缓存还是第三方 API（Unknown in Fact #5）。\n2. **依赖故障根因**：未查明导致该依赖不可用的具体网络或上游服务故障（Unknown in Fact #5）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 71.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l: 71.6s (Evidence 63.5s, RCA 8.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 103.218, "metrics": {"run_id": "77721463c8564621", "mttr": {"value": "1.7m", "seconds": 103.22452807426453, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "51%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 103224.52807426453, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 68613.72995376587, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 87722.4452495575, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 34250.10538101196}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 20991.80316925049, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 71633.93449783325, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10577.94976234436, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

